  ["Harira (Classic Recipe)","Moroccan",["1 onion, diced", "2 celery stalks, diced", "1 cup chickpeas, soaked", "1/2 cup brown lentils", "1 can crushed tomatoes", "6 cups stock", "1 tsp turmeric", "1 tsp ginger", "Cilantro, parsley", "2 tbsp flour whisked with water (tedouira)"],["Simmer onion, celery, chickpeas, lentils, tomatoes and spices 40 minutes.", "Whisk in the tedouira; simmer 10 minutes until silky.", "Stir in masses of cilantro and parsley; serve with lemon."],"20 min","50 min"]
